{
  "name": "m4-ptyper-overhead-full",
  "description": [
    "What the parallel typer spike costs the ordinary serial compiler, and what its one-thread parallel path costs on top, on full compiles of re2s, each build in forks of its own. `aa` is `base` again: the fork-to-fork noise floor.",
    "",
    "Serial overhead: `base` \u2192 `guards` \u2192 `spike` \u2192 `fix`. Parallel overhead: `spike` \u2192 `par1`, `fix` \u2192 `par1fix`. xctrace's per-thread counters miss the worker thread of `par1` and `par1fix`: compare those by time and the all-threads counters."
  ],
